"""ABRASAX supervisor — 30s automation loop.

Every tick:
  1. probe every service in abrasax.services (parallel TCP, 0.6s)
  2. auto-start any down service on the AUTOSTART allowlist (cooldown 180s)
  3. integrity-check the root tree (expected dirs / key files)
  4. append a ledger event + rewrite state + heartbeat

Usage:
    python supervisor.py                # resident, 30s ticks
    python supervisor.py --once        # single tick (debug)
    python supervisor.py --dry-run     # probe + integrity only, never start
    python supervisor.py --interval 30 # custom tick seconds

The resident run is idempotent: a PID lock in LOGS/supervisor.pid keeps a
second instance from starting (safe to relaunch from the watchdog task).
"""
from __future__ import annotations

